{"abstract":"This paper introduces a novel multimodal corpus consisting of 12 video recordings of Zoom meetings held in English by an international group of researchers from September 2021 to March 2023. The meetings have an average duration of about 40 minutes each, for a total of 8 hours. The number of participants varies from 5 to 9 per meeting. The participants' speech was transcribed automatically using WhisperX, while visual coordinates of several keypoints of the participants' head, their shoulders and wrists, were extracted using OpenPose. The audio-visual recordings will be distributed together with the orthographic transcription as well as the visual coordinates. In the paper we describe the way the corpus was collected, transcribed and enriched with the visual coordinates, we give descriptive statistics concerning both the speech transcription and the visual keypoint values and we present and discuss visualisations of these values. Finally, we carry out a short preliminary analysis of the role of feedback in the meetings, and show how visualising the coordinates extracted via OpenPose can be used to see how gestural behaviour supports the use of feedback words during the interaction.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Paggio, Patrizia","Aguirrezabal Zabaleta, Manex","Navarretta, Costanza","Vitasovic, Leo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-764903"],"event":{"end":"2024-05-25","place":"Hybrid, Torino, it","start":"2024-05-20","title":"Joint 30th International Conference on Computational Linguistics and 14th International Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation, LREC-COLING 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multimodal behaviour in an online environment the gehm zoom corpus collection","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-SA","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.1038.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-764903","identifier":[{"id":"85195947082","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-4a91490b-fef4-4a3e-b0a3-3edbcf283754"],"keyword":["Zoom meetings","multimodal corpus","visual keypoints"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-254E1283EC7A05E5D3FFC4499A088749"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-SA","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.1038.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Nordic Studies and Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Patrizia","key":"paggiopau","last":"Paggio","locid":"d41bc81d-6770-4bc7-8329-8c12f9ac1742","name":"Paggio, Patrizia","orcid":"0000-0002-2484-2275","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Manex","key":"agirrezabalpau","last":"Agirrezabal","locid":"5506d065-a31f-447b-b859-cc101b4c91e0","name":"Aguirrezabal Zabaleta, Manex","name_org":"Agirrezabal, Manex","orcid":"0000-0001-5909-2745","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Costanza","key":"navarrettapau","last":"Navarretta","locid":"5bd233c0-eec1-41ab-bc2b-39ad39ad11b1","name":"Navarretta, Costanza","orcid":"0000-0002-4242-9249","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Leo","key":"vitasovicpau","last":"Vitasovic","name":"Vitasovic, Leo","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicoletta","key":"calzolaripedh","last":"Calzolari","name":"Calzolari, Nicoletta","rank":5,